WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.397
Long, long ago, there was a king who was very vain.

2
00:00:05.398 --> 00:00:09.592
He liked to wear only new and beautiful clothes.

3
00:00:09.593 --> 00:00:13.921
He did not care about his soldiers or his servants.

4
00:00:13.922 --> 00:00:17.482
He only cared about his clothes.

5
00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:20.084
Two crooks heard about the vain king.

6
00:00:20.085 --> 00:00:25.836
"Hmm, the king only cares about new and beautiful clothes."

7
00:00:25.837 --> 00:00:30.866
"He is so vain. Let's trick him!"

8
00:00:30.867 --> 00:00:32.205
"How?"

9
00:00:32.206 --> 00:00:37.094
"Let's pretend to sew some new clothes for the king.

10
00:00:37.095 --> 00:00:42.948
We will say that the clothes are invisible only to foolish people."

11
00:00:42.949 --> 00:00:45.439
"What a good idea!

12
00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:55.476
Then nobody can tell the king that there is really no cloth at all."

13
00:00:55.477 --> 00:01:01.913
So the crooks went to meet the king. They brought a loom with them too.

14
00:01:01.914 --> 00:01:08.647
"Your Majesty, our loom is very special. It makes beautiful cloth.

15
00:01:08.648 --> 00:01:13.663
Also, the cloth can only be seen by smart people.

16
00:01:13.664 --> 00:01:17.927
Let us make some beautiful clothes for you from this cloth."

17
00:01:17.928 --> 00:01:24.893
"Hmm. Okay, make me some new clothes!"

18
00:01:24.894 --> 00:01:34.113
"Yes, Your Majesty. But first, give us some golden silk and golden buttons for your new clothes."

19
00:01:34.114 --> 00:01:37.836
Every day the crooks pretended to sew.

20
00:01:37.837 --> 00:01:42.036
So they made loud noises with the loom.

21
00:01:42.037 --> 00:01:48.648
And every day the crooks asked for more golden silk and golden buttons.

22
00:01:48.649 --> 00:01:52.206
But none were used for the king's new clothes.

23
00:01:52.207 --> 00:01:57.457
The crooks kept all of the materials for themselves.

24
00:01:57.458 --> 00:02:02.305
"Go and see how soon my beautiful clothes will be ready."

25
00:02:02.306 --> 00:02:04.999
"Yes, Your Majesty."

26
00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:11.606
"Oh no! I can't see anything at all! Am I stupid?

27
00:02:11.607 --> 00:02:19.950
What will I tell the king? I must lie or lose my job!"

28
00:02:19.951 --> 00:02:23.886
"Oh, what beautiful clothes you are making!"

29
00:02:23.887 --> 00:02:32.584
"Thank you! Please tell the king that his new clothes are done."

30
00:02:32.585 --> 00:02:39.659
"Your Majesty! Now your clothes are done. The clothes are very wonderful."

31
00:02:39.660 --> 00:02:43.957
"Good! I will wear them in the parade today.

32
00:02:43.958 --> 00:02:50.466
Then everyone will admire me in my beautiful clothes."

33
00:02:50.467 --> 00:02:53.516
The crooks showed the king the new clothes.

34
00:02:53.517 --> 00:02:57.608
But they only pretended to hold up the new clothes.

35
00:02:57.609 --> 00:03:02.827
"Oh no! I can't see anything at all!

36
00:03:02.828 --> 00:03:10.030
I must pretend to see these new clothes or everyone will know that I am stupid."

37
00:03:10.031 --> 00:03:15.061
"Ah, how beautiful my new clothes look!"

38
00:03:15.062 --> 00:03:19.440
"Here, Your Majesty. Let me help you put them on.

39
00:03:19.441 --> 00:03:24.602
I am sure they will fit you perfectly."

40
00:03:24.603 --> 00:03:31.335
Soon the parade began. The king smiled and began to walk down the street.

41
00:03:31.336 --> 00:03:36.658
Everyone was shocked because the king was wearing only his underwear.

42
00:03:36.659 --> 00:03:40.492
But they pretended to admire the king's new clothes.

43
00:03:40.493 --> 00:03:43.753
They did not want to seem stupid too.

44
00:03:43.754 --> 00:03:47.193
"Oh, how wonderful the king looks!"

45
00:03:47.194 --> 00:03:51.691
"What beautiful new clothes!"

46
00:03:51.692 --> 00:03:56.760
But as the king walked down the street, some children began to laugh.

47
00:03:56.761 --> 00:04:04.074
"Oh! Ha-ha-ha! Look at the king! He is only wearing his underwear."

48
00:04:04.075 --> 00:04:08.155
"What a foolish and stupid boy!"

49
00:04:08.156 --> 00:04:14.731
"Oh my! The king is only wearing his underwear! Ha-ha-ha!"

50
00:04:14.732 --> 00:04:19.232
Soon everyone watching the parade began to whisper.

51
00:04:19.233 --> 00:04:23.781
Their whispering grew louder and louder.

52
00:04:23.782 --> 00:04:32.223
"Oh my! I have been tricked! I am so ashamed and stupid!

53
00:04:32.224 --> 00:04:38.438
What should I do now?"

54
00:04:38.439 --> 00:04:41.446
The king wanted to stop the parade.

55
00:04:41.447 --> 00:04:47.119
But it was too late to admit that he was only wearing his underwear.

56
00:04:47.120 --> 00:04:55.555
So the parade continued. But the embarrassed king's face turned very red.

